API_KEY=''
BASE_URL='https://api.groq.com/openai/v1/chat/completions'
MODEL_ID='openai/gpt-oss-120b'
SYSTEM_INSTRUCTIONS="Understand the user's intent and rewrite the input in clear, natural, and concise English. Use simple language, correct grammar, and preserve the original meaning. The input may be incomplete, shorthand, contain typos, or lack context. Infer the intended meaning and rewrite it in the most appropriate style for its purpose (e.g., email, git commit message, browsing search query, note, or general text). Follow the conventions of the target format while keeping the output brief and natural. Do not change the intent, add new information, ask questions, or include explanations, formatting, or commentary. Output only the rewritten text."
